<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vincam started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vincam started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Bernad Picchi started coverage of On Assignment Inc and Vincam Group Inc with buy ratings and added both companies to the Lehman Emerging Growth Stocks list.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $60 per share on Vincam.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Vincam rose 2-1/2 to 44-1/2 and On Assignment rose two to 32-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
